@startuml eventbus-architecture
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"

package "Core" #FFF8DC {
  class RadarController
}

package "Event API" #E6F7FF {
  interface IEventBus {
    + Subscribe<T>()
    + Publish<T>()
    + Enqueue<T>()
    + BeginCycle()
    + DispatchCurrentCycle()
    + EndCycle()
  }
  class EventToken
}

package "Implementations" #F6FFED {
  class EventBus
  class CycleEventBus
  IEventBus <|.. EventBus
  IEventBus <|.. CycleEventBus
}

package "eventpp adapters" #FFF1F0 {
  class EventDispatcher
  class EventQueue
}

package "Events" #F9F0FF {
  class TracksUpdatedEvent
  class JammingAlertEvent
  class CommandsSubmittedEvent
  class RadarCycleCompletedEvent
}

RadarController --> IEventBus : use via abstraction
RadarController --> TracksUpdatedEvent
RadarController --> JammingAlertEvent
RadarController --> CommandsSubmittedEvent
RadarController --> RadarCycleCompletedEvent

EventBus --> EventDispatcher : immediate dispatch
CycleEventBus --> EventQueue : double-buffer queue

note right of EventBus
Publish/Enqueue -> dispatch immediately
适合即时响应路径
end note

note right of CycleEventBus
BeginCycle: swap queues
DispatchCurrentCycle: process current
Publish/Enqueue: always enqueue to next
end note

@enduml
